{
  "_about": "v79.14.1 (item 2): the institution's governing law -- what decides whether §1's honesty line «Il corpus non contiene ancora informazioni sufficienti su <materia>» (lawyer_method.CORPUS_LINE) may fire: only when the governing law is outside the codes (c.c., c.p., c.p.c., c.p.p., c.p.a., the Constitution, the disposizioni di attuazione: family_gate.ordinary_code) AND missing from the archive (data/corpus_expected.json «archive_names», or a data/special_laws.json entry's, against the graph's primary document names: corpus_laws.names; unknown names -- the graph not read -- never fire). The entries are read in order, the first that matches decides (the special laws first, then the codes) -- so a special law's pattern names its own matter only, never a word a code institution shares («fallimento delle trattative» is art. 1337 c.c., «furto tentato fallito» the c.p., «vita privata» art. 615-bis c.p.: «fallimento» needs the impresa, the dichiarazione or the procedure; «privacy» and «dati personali» their treatment or code). Each entry: «patterns» (regular expressions, case-insensitive, read on a first-read institution's name and rubricated name) and «law» (a code's sigla, or a law as data/corpus_expected.json keys it -- «d.lgs. 79/2011», «L. 633/1941»). An institution no entry names takes the law of the institution module it names (data/institution_modules.json: the law of the module's leading action -- a code article first is a code institution; a special law's article first, its «laws»' first: responsabilità sanitaria is L. 24/2017), else the code of a record whose rubrica is the institution's rubricated name, else a law or an article cited in the institution's own words; none of these: the governing law is unknown and the line never fires (lawyer_method.governing_law). A code institution never prints it: legittima difesa (art. 52 c.p.) is the c.p. v79.14.2 (B): «penal»: true flags a penal source -- the c.p. and the c.p.p. entries, and the penal laws (d.P.R. 309/1990, d.lgs. 231/2001) -- what a verified penal frame with the client imputato or indagato may offer as the charge (lawyer_method.penal_source: the codes c.p. and c.p.p., case_frame.is_penal for a law case_frame.json's penal_provisions lists -- its penal articles by range --, and a flagged law it does not list, whole). Code's draft list, for the lawyer's review; edit here.",
